<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Hello, {{name}} · Norm</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; color: #17332c; background: #f3f5ee; }
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; }
    main { width: min(680px, calc(100% - 64px)); padding: 64px 0; }
    .label { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; color: #537367; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 72px); letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: 1.1; margin: 24px 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    p { color: #537367; line-height: 1.8; }
    ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 36px 0; border-top: 1px solid #ced9cb; }
    li { padding: 16px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ced9cb; }
    a { color: #16694a; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
    footer { margin-top: 48px; font-size: 13px; color: #537367; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <div class="label">NORM / SERVER SIDE HTML</div>
    <h1>Hello, {{name}}.</h1>
    <p>一个由 Norm、Micronaut 和 JStachio 渲染的页面。</p>
    {{#showFeatures}}
    <ul>{{#features}}<li>{{.}}</li>{{/features}}</ul>
    {{/showFeatures}}
    <a href="/greeting?name=Norm">查看内联模板 →</a>
    <footer>修改地址栏中的 ?name= 参数，试试你的名字。</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
